  {
   "id": "wand-order-tidy-up-the-magic-shop-411997@1.1",
   "gameId": "wand-order-tidy-up-the-magic-shop-411997",
   "displayName": "Hotfix 1.1",
   "kind": "hotfix",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-09-24T10:06:17.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "❗ WARNING: If you load a saved game in Zone 1 (Tarot) you might need to take a look at the Major Arcana you have placed (Blue & Purple) as some might need to be moved. (Changed from Silver to Gold)",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello everyone!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We have just pushed an update with a ton of fixes that you have suggested and bugs you have found. These include:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Adjusted the names / colors / groups of some items (Major Arcana are not grouped according to The Fool's Journey.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Some indicators in the intro scene and Zone 1 to act as a guiding hand for unclear tasks. (Like reading the paper message at the beginning)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed Text scaling issues in some languages",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed UI scaling for Ultra wide monitors",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added mouse smoothing toggle in settings",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "new",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Language change should be saved between game sessions",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "SFX for placement was not changing volume with SFX slider",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Other bug fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Keep in mind that Steam Reviews are very important to us, so don't forget to write one!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "As always, if you find anything or need help, let us know here or on discord! (JOIN HERE)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "OnSkull Games",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
